<title>USA: Industrial Scientific Q4 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Industrial Scientific Q4 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>			  01/25/97    01/27/96  01/25/97   01/27/96</p>
<p> Net sales		$9,559	$8,445   $36,648    $34,133</p>
<p> Net income		  746	 1,070     3,725	4,067</p>
<p>Net income per</p>
<p>  common share	    0.22	  0.31	1.10	 1.20</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of common and common</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	    3,369	 3,383     3,375	3,384</p>
<p>		    (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for the fourth quarter of 1995 included a nonrecurring positive adjustment of $240,000 related to a provision for profit sharing.</p>
<p>The company said the fourth quarter period ended January 25, 1997.</p>
</text>
